{
  "description": "Every way a prompt goes, or doesn't. relay docs is idle and answers two seconds late, so your prompt shows on its way; flood bench is busy, so a prompt queues; theme picker's host (studio) is away, so sending waits with the draft kept. cabin backups shows a refused prompt: freeze its agent so the host cannot answer (`just tui-set sending --door '{\"Freeze\": {\"agent\": \"cabin backups\"}}'` from another terminal), send, then drop the link (`--door '{\"Sever\": {\"a\": \"laptop\", \"b\": \"cabin\"}}'`): the prompt comes back into the composer, not sent because the host is unreachable. Restore and Thaw undo it.",
